{"term":{"label":"信","occurrences":1,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii","title":"離婁下","description":"孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"信","id":"信"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"右","id":"右"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"孟子","id":"孟子"},{"form":"師","id":"師"},{"form":"後","id":"後"},{"form":"必","id":"必"},{"form":"死","id":"死"},{"form":"當","id":"當"},{"form":"罪","id":"罪"},{"form":"言","id":"言"},{"form":"足","id":"足"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.5520685823000399,"source":"人","target":"大"},{"weight":1.6506808709681495,"source":"人","target":"信"},{"weight":3.091042453358316,"source":"信","target":"大"},{"weight":3.091042453358316,"source":"信","target":"必"},{"weight":2.8903717578961645,"source":"信","target":"言"},{"weight":2.9856819377004897,"source":"死","target":"事"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"死","target":"大"},{"weight":2.803360380906535,"source":"死","target":"當"},{"weight":3.3141860046725258,"source":"右","target":"師"},{"weight":2.1972245773362196,"source":"右","target":"言"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"右","target":"孟子"},{"weight":2.2925347571405443,"source":"足","target":"事"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"足","target":"大"},{"weight":2.1102132003465894,"source":"足","target":"當"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"罪","target":"大"},{"weight":0.8938178760220965,"source":"必","target":"大"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"source":"必","target":"言"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"必","target":"反"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"必","target":"後"},{"weight":1.4170660197866443,"source":"當","target":"後"},{"weight":2.580216829592325,"source":"當","target":"事"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"當","target":"大"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"sourc